      en: ["Located between the Bafing and Bakoy river drainage basins.", "Average elevations reach 450 meters in the highland areas.", "Part of the Bafoulabé district within the western Kayes region.", "Contains significant iron ore deposits for potential future mining.", "Historical territory of the pre-colonial Mali Empire provinces.", "The rugged landscape features seasonal waterfalls and deep gorges."],
      es: ["Altitud máxima: 800 m", "Longitud: aprox. 60 km", "Roca: granito, gneis (Precámbrico)", "Divisoria de aguas entre Níger y Senegal", "Recursos minerales: oro", "Agricultura: mijo, cacahuetes"],
      pt: ["Altitude máxima: 800 m", "Comprimento: cerca de 60 km", "Rocha: granito, gnaisse (Pré-cambriano)", "Divisória de águas entre Níger e Senegal", "Recursos minerais: ouro", "Agricultura: milho-painço, amendoim"],
      fr: ["Altitude maximale : 800 m", "Longueur : environ 60 km", "Roche : granite, gneiss (Précambrien)", "Ligne de partage des eaux entre Niger et Sénégal", "Ressources : or", "Agriculture : mil, arachides"],
