      en: ["Designated as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1989.", "The escarpment extends for approximately 150 kilometers.", "Cliffs reach heights of up to 500 meters above the sandy plain.", "Home to the Dogon people and their unique cliffside architecture.", "Site of ancient Tellem dwellings dating back several centuries.", "Located within the administrative Mopti region of central Mali."],
